 The author of this file, Steve Reid <steve@edmweb.com>, placed it in the
 public domain with the notice "100% Public Domain" at the top of the file
 (src/sha1.c). There is no licence text to reproduce, because there is no
 licence: the author disclaimed copyright entirely.
 .
 Debian's copyright-format specification requires a License paragraph for
 every short name a Files paragraph refers to, and public-domain has no
 common-licenses text to point at, so the paragraph records the disclaimer
 and where it is stated instead.
